<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The Subscriber hereby acknowledges and agrees that, without the consent of Blackstone Real Estate Income Advisors L.L.C., the Fund&#146;s investment adviser,
